dev-S1 is a development set on scenes held out of training. Two existing checkpoints (the next training leg's parent "CP1 m200" and the earlier line "f17") must be read on it now, so that the new leg's first milestone can be compared with them on the same items. No evaluation kit can read these rows yet: the frames are PNG files chosen by a plan, not videos.

## Read first
- The operator's scope note with the fixed item list and the open points: /scratch/jjyeung/orch_cd/evalx/events/20261112T0340Z_NOTE_devS1_items_v1_and_scope.md. The item list is /scratch/jjyeung/orch_cd/evalx/out/DEV_S1_ITEMS_v1.jsonl (2,136 items; sha256 in the .sha256 file beside it; never change it).
